Subject: usb: dwc3: support a shared data path across two Type-C connectors

Adapted from h0cheung/tb322fc-linux-kernel commit 6f97250ead155fc3b980856323e99a4623dae73d.
Keep non-mux reset behavior and exclude unrelated full suspend reinitialization.

